rynas (0.1.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * First package: rynasd (PAM, TOTP) and rynas-web (API, live metrics,
    web interface), systemd units, PAM service, fail2ban examples.
  * The web interface is plain HTTP on port 8080 for now; HTTPS comes in a
    later release (see README.Debian).

